  "title": "Spanish Garlic Shrimp (Gambas al Ajillo)",
  "description": "Gambas al ajillo are a classic Spanish tapas dish of juicy shrimp in garlic-infused olive oil with smoky paprika and sherry that cooks in minutes.",
